; Nolang doc catalog: zh-CN
; Source-comment translations, keyed by the anchor an author wrote in a
; trailing `[label](#anchor)` line. Keys come from en.doc.noml; never invent one.
; A missing key falls back to the comment text in the source, so an untranslated
; block degrades to the author's language rather than disappearing.
{
  'args.count': `
count: 参数数量（含程序名）
委派至 os.args() builtin（返回完整 argv 向量，取其长度）
`
  'args.get': `
get: 获取第 i 个参数
委派至 os.arg(i) builtin（读取 main 的 argv[i]）；越界返回 nil
`
  'args.program': 'program: 程序名（第 0 个参数）'
}
